# Runtime browser cache (NOT your contacts — those live in contacts.json)
# If you ever want to nuke the browser-side cache, just delete this entry.
# Keeping it ignored prevents stale localStorage snapshots from being committed.

# But explicitly DO commit your real data:
!contacts.json

# Don't commit the icon generation script's intermediate files (none currently, but safe)
# icon-192.png, icon-512.png, icon-maskable-512.png, apple-touch-icon.png, favicon-32.png are committed (PWA needs them)
